xfce4-launcher-colors (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package. Ships the GTK3 module and its CSS provider (slices
    1-3): colours are read from ~/.config/xfce4-launcher-colors/colors.css
    and painted onto matching launchers at panel start.
  * The context-menu item and the colour chooser are not implemented yet
    (slice 4), so colours must be written to colors.css by hand for now.
  * The module is installed but not enabled; see README for how to load it.

 -- Jorge Alonso <desarrollos@enfoquestic.com>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
